<% content_for :header do %>
  User repository now accessible by a member of <%= @business.name %>
<% end %>

<%= render Mail::HeaderTitleComponent.new \
  title: "User repository now accessible by #{@unlocked_by}", avatar_plus_avatar: [@business, @user] %>

Hi <strong><%= @user.display_login %></strong>,

<%= render(Mail::SpacerComponent.new) %>

<strong><%= @unlocked_by %></strong>, a member of the <strong><%= @business.name %></strong> enterprise, has been granted temporary access to
your <strong><%= @repo_name %></strong> user repository for up to <strong><%= @access_duration.inspect %></strong>.

<%= render(Mail::SpacerComponent.new) %>

Repositories in an enterprise may be subject to enterprise-wide audits and reviews.
If you would like more information or believe this action has been taken in error, please contact an enterprise owner.

<% content_for :footer_text do %>
  You are receiving this email because a member of the <%= @business.name %> enterprise has been granted temporary
  access to your user repository.
<% end %>
